>>> 1
}

# an05: pronoun with a single gender match, other referent -- new
{
Sue met Bill.
He smiled.
====
Sue smiled.
>>> 0
}

# an06: pronoun with a single gender match, negated -- new
{
Sue met Bill.
He smiled.
